  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australian NGO Cooperation Program (ANCP) Anticipatory Action Pilot</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australian NGO Cooperation Program (ANCP) investment to pilot Anticipatory Action initiatives aiming to better support key issues at the nexus of stabilization and resilience, through more adaptive program cycle management, risk-informed design, and by testing the feasibility of a crisis modifier.</narrative>
  </description>
